  'lf.south_plug': [P, 'Ch5 performed (staged): you look over the south plug and haul it out; you look across to the north plug still holding the water.', 'tests/e2e/staging_chapters.mjs (Ch5/Ch6 cases in tests/e2e/staging_ch56_cases.mjs; 3 branches: pulled, leave it, out already)'],
